 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 0.15,
   "speechStart": 0.15,
   "end": 2.6,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Now a killer you can’t see or smell."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 2.85,
   "speechStart": 2.85,
   "end": 4.725,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Carbon monoxide."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 4.975,
   "speechStart": 4.975,
   "end": 11.125,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "It’s colorless, odorless, and deadly, and it’s in the exhaust of every engine and generator."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 11.375,
   "speechStart": 11.375,
   "end": 17.2,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "It collects near the stern, on and around the swim platform, and in enclosed cabins."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 17.45,
   "speechStart": 17.45,
   "end": 19.425,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "It can follow you, too."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 19.675,
   "speechStart": 19.675,
   "end": 26.05,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Underway, the airflow behind the boat can pull exhaust back aboard, especially with canvas up."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 26.3,
   "speechStart": 26.3,
   "end": 28.975,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "That’s called the station wagon effect."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 29.225,
   "speechStart": 29.225,
   "end": 33.05,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "The early symptoms are headache, nausea and dizziness."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 33.3,
   "speechStart": 33.3,
   "end": 35.6,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "What does that sound like on a boat?"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 35.85,
   "speechStart": 36.6,
   "end": 38.25,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Seasickness."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 38.5,
   "speechStart": 38.5,
   "end": 44.225,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "So when a passenger feels sick in the cabin with the generator running, don’t assume it’s the waves."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 44.475,
   "speechStart": 44.475,
   "end": 46.5,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Get them into fresh air."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 46.75,
   "speechStart": 46.75,
   "end": 51.325,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Install and test carbon monoxide alarms in enclosed spaces."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 51.575,
   "speechStart": 51.575,
   "end": 56.675,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "And nobody hangs on the swim platform with an engine or generator running."
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 56.925,
   "speechStart": 56.925,
   "end": 58.275,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Ever."
  }
 ]
}
